Package: nglib
Type: Package
Title: Plotting Themes, Color Scales and Exploratory Data Analysis Plots
Version: 1.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Nitin", "Gupta", , "gupta.nitin1@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Provides the 'ggplot2' themes theme_quant() and theme_poster(), custom
    discrete and continuous color/fill scales built on a set of named
    palettes, a family of quick exploratory data analysis (EDA) plots for
    univariate, bivariate and multivariate views of a data frame, a
    clustered correlation heat map, and a few small data-wrangling helpers.
